==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*new- (new)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|newe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nīewe}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*niwi}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*niwjaz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*néwyos|t=new}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*néwos}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|new|t=new}}, {{cog|fy|nij|t=new}}, {{cog|nl|nieuw|t=new}}, {{cog|nds|nee|t=new}}, {{cog|de|neu|t=new}}, {{m+|da|-}}, {{m+|no|-}} and {{cog|sv|ny|t=new}}, {{cog|is|nýr|t=new}}, {{cog|fo|nýggjur|t=new}}, {{cog|la|novus|t=new}}, {{cog|grc|νέος|t=new}}, {{cog|cy|newydd|t=new}}, {{cog|ru|но́вый|t=new}}, {{cog|hy|նոր|t=new}}, {{cog|fa|نو|t=now}},{{cog|kmr|nû|t=new}}, {{cog|hi|नया|t=new}}, {{cog|txb|ñuwe|t=new}}.
{{rel-bottom}}
Compare also {{cog|ang|nū|t=now}}. More at {{m|en|now}}. {{doublet|en|nuevo|novuss}}.

