#: {{ux|en|Are you going to buy a '''new''' car or a second-hand one?}}
# [[refresh|Refreshed]], [[reinvigorate]]d, [[reform]]ed.
#: {{ux|en|That shirt is dirty. Go and put on a '''new''' one.&nbsp;&nbsp; I feel like a '''new''' person after a good night's sleep.&nbsp;&nbsp; After the accident, I saw the world with '''new''' eyes.}}
# [[newborn|Newborn]].
#: {{ux|en|My sister has a '''new''' baby, and our mother is excited to finally have a grandchild.}}
# [[strange|Strange]], [[unfamiliar]] or not previously [[know]]n.
